# Jump Scare: "... becomes a Horror enchantment creature in addition to its other types." On turn 3 Bot1 casts it on its Llanowar
# Elves. While Jump Scare is on the stack the Elves are not yet an enchantment, so Bot2's Disenchant ("Destroy target artifact or
# enchantment") can't target them; once it has resolved they are one (CR 205.1b, 613.1d), and the Disenchant destroys them.

